{
  "$comment": "Blender-built kitchen models (tools/art/blender/families/kitchen.py). Replaces the primitive-part placeholders by key; listed in the base manifest's packs. The placeholder is kept as a fallback if a file fails to load, and the materials map onto the game's finishes so a model costs one draw call per finish group. Each sink has a `water_on` clip (the stream from the tap) played while a resident washes up.",
